        "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Shoot first. Then ask questions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What? He... disappeared?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... I saw your file. You're Faust, one of their leaders. Your Arts won't fool me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know this is just an optical trick. If I shoot, you'll still have a bolt in your head.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wrong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
